  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - It is considered that the single storey side and rear extensions by reason of their excessive depth and width to the rear would cause harm to neighbours living conditions through a loss of light and outlook, would fail to remain subordinate to the main house and would therefore fail to preserve or enhance the character or appearance of Bedfont Green Conservation Area. The proposal is therefore contrary to Unitary Development Plan Policies ENV-B.1.1 (New Developments), H.6.4 (Extensions and Alterations), ENV-B.2.2 (Conservation Areas) and Emerging Local Plan policies CC1 (Context and Character), CC2 (Urban design and architecture), SC7 (Residential Extensions) and the Residential Extension Guidelines SPG."
